# Netlify applies these response headers site-wide.
# Ported from the old Apache .htaccess, which Netlify silently ignored — so
# until now the site shipped with NO security headers despite intending to.
# Caching + compression are left to Netlify's defaults so that unversioned
# assets (styles.css, main.js, content.json, resume.pdf) still revalidate and
# updates go live immediately instead of being frozen by a 1-year immutable cache.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
